  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "2020年高雄同志遊行"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>作者：烏籽（Oo-tsí）</b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj0d8uPa2tvxOpbBdK8NQQYcS_EbxqYqYdYFCXsKmS8NQnsws6dCYxAOwE7vL7kJWQXC48Pk6Ukqx4JM4Z1zROLqOFeSiqU4Y-Jx-wQ7MLbov4PEHBfJ5TnJnppZt9qoWbOqp7YZubwQSY1/s2048/%25E6%2595%25A3%25E6%2596%2587+%25E5%2590%25B3%25E8%2595%2599%25E8%258F%2581+%25E9%25AB%2598%25E9%259B%2584%25E5%2590%258C%25E5%25BF%2597%25E9%2581%258A%25E8%25A1%258C+20201208.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1536\" data-original-width=\"2048\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj0d8uPa2tvxOpbBdK8NQQYcS_EbxqYqYdYFCXsKmS8NQnsws6dCYxAOwE7vL7kJWQXC48Pk6Ukqx4JM4Z1zROLqOFeSiqU4Y-Jx-wQ7MLbov4PEHBfJ5TnJnppZt9qoWbOqp7YZubwQSY1/w640-h480/%25E6%2595%25A3%25E6%2596%2587+%25E5%2590%25B3%25E8%2595%2599%25E8%258F%2581+%25E9%25AB%2598%25E9%259B%2584%25E5%2590%258C%25E5%25BF%2597%25E9%2581%258A%25E8%25A1%258C+20201208.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><b><br /></b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\">舊年11月28是高雄同志遊行ê日子，mā是我頭一kái tī高雄參加同志遊行，參加ê人bē少，會場tsinn kah插插插，tsiânn濟人用心打扮，也有裝翼--ê、也有穿禮服--ê——逐家lóng tsiânn大方表現家己，想beh借遊行ê機會，hōo社會各界理解同志kah其他性少數是有影存在--ê。</div></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\">遊行ê主題是「We around you」，我想，是希望逐家知影，雖然平常時你無一定ē發現性少數ê存在，m̄-koh in其實lóng是你身軀邊ê普通人——就像我，若無特別講，也無人ē發現已經有男朋友ê我是雙性戀——所以遊行ê重要，就是ài hông看著你，tsiah ē-tàng hōo外箍圍ê人知影，tsia-ê人lóng是平凡ê存在。</div></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\">規个遊行隊伍tuì高雄ê大成路口接tuì五福三路，成功一路倒uat中正四路接大公路、七賢三路koh se̍h tńg去公園路。雖然路程無短，suah是行kah tsiânn緊，規大kuānn人兩點外tsiah出發，五點就已經全部tńg來到會場--ah。雖然氣氛tsiânn好，m̄-koh我感覺高雄遊行整體來講，iáu是比tī台北遊行幼秀tsiânn濟；提枋仔寫主張ê人khah少，逐家mā khah bē tī路--裡停落來hip相交談，就是khah pì-sù--lah！</div></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ná像有人bat講，可能因為tsit兩冬同志kah性少數tī政治訴求ê成果bē-bái（雖然無夠圓滿，至少大多數iáu是有thang結婚--ah），tsit兩冬tī台北ê同志遊行ê時，提枋仔寫主張ê人uân-á比khah早無hiah濟--ah，m̄知高雄ê狀況是因為pì-sù，iah是kah台北仝款？</div></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\">M̄管啥原因，tī tsit个逐家lóng teh展現家己ê場合，我感覺若kan-na tuè leh行就siunn過無彩，所致我用台文做貼紙mā做kha̋ng-páng，希望逐家看著mā有台語人／台員人支持tsit个議題。提tsit塊kha̋ng-páng行遊行ê時，我無tiānn-tiānn kā枋仔攑--起-來，因為提kha̋ng-páng ê人真正少，只要提--起-來就tsiânn濟人ē金金siòng，我koh歹勢kâng解sueh，所致囥--落-來ê時間比攑--起-來ke tsiânn濟。好佳哉，pun貼紙ê時逐家就ē看著kha̋ng-páng，koh有幾若个人看--著就tuè leh唸，雖然無一定正確，但是我感覺án-ne就tsiânn有意義，tī 99％華語ê活動現場，hōo台語有出現hông聽--著ê機會。</div></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\">就像同志遊行ê主題「We around you」beh表達ê意義，我mā希望ē-hiáu寫台文、講台語ê台員人，ē-tàng濟濟參與tsia-ê議題活動，其他參加活動ê人有機會看著台文、講台語，hōo逐家了解tsia-ê議題m̄是kan-na ē-tàng用華語來表達，台語就有機會「around everywhere」。</div></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\">高雄ê朋友，今年做伙來遊行！</div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi-anrSHrw1-9z3KFwBYPG82UNMqHNRiW5A2BQu-vRC2RoUAGV8OtZcbZMqrpnsEThmicLJO2qU5lrZwMoAy6XuugC_my0x0DFX7-fyccA2Tcyn4GEq0_YV_sHnWGjMX0G3yO1b-l8p1JJJ/s525/252861567_6274292544978_8460716853803951303_n.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"350\" data-original-width=\"525\" height=\"426\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi-anrSHrw1-9z3KFwBYPG82UNMqHNRiW5A2BQu-vRC2RoUAGV8OtZcbZMqrpnsEThmicLJO2qU5lrZwMoAy6XuugC_my0x0DFX7-fyccA2Tcyn4GEq0_YV_sHnWGjMX0G3yO1b-l8p1JJJ/w640-h426/252861567_6274292544978_8460716853803951303_n.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg1FquXl5O77H-CJs8Dj3W2cAIn7rTf8dWv_OzH_WIiTsQzdYjyL05cqw7uU2zgwSeqHrlD8XBJCRG5LJH4Fpo5p7MPQytpcYed7YyeyPdwKcPbjjon0vK145XiT52Gh6DtSIWUGSD94r8X/s2048/%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1332%25E6%259C%259F_0607.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1446\" data-original-width=\"2048\" height=\"452\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg1FquXl5O77H-CJs8Dj3W2cAIn7rTf8dWv_OzH_WIiTsQzdYjyL05cqw7uU2zgwSeqHrlD8XBJCRG5LJH4Fpo5p7MPQytpcYed7YyeyPdwKcPbjjon0vK145XiT52Gh6DtSIWUGSD94r8X/w640-h452/%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1332%25E6%259C%259F_0607.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br /><b>編按：受疫情影響，高雄同志遊行延期到明年（2022）tsiah辦，m̄-koh tī 11/27 ē有一場線頂活動，詳細請參考「高雄同志大遊行」面冊專頁公告<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/KaohsiungPRIDE/?ref=page_internal\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/KaohsiungPRIDE/?ref=page_internal</a></b></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgq8Myt6T8_PpmJddPZT0W6dKDZBgyC-fF0wIzdnX7X1LWNhjqUWg7YYx0IS3kVYh1zfoAujn8Op_xQZ9HVeRfi53Toh-1sqPqSUfEcC4ViCpcVHJIFsO-861LwoqWF4dgGFexbL7e0EL1X/s150/2021%25E9%25AB%2598%25E9%259B%2584%25E5%2590%258C%25E5%25BF%2597%25E5%25A4%25A7%25E9%2581%258A%25E8%25A1%258C_qrcode.png\" style=\"clear: left; float: left; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"150\" data-original-width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgq8Myt6T8_PpmJddPZT0W6dKDZBgyC-fF0wIzdnX7X1LWNhjqUWg7YYx0IS3kVYh1zfoAujn8Op_xQZ9HVeRfi53Toh-1sqPqSUfEcC4ViCpcVHJIFsO-861LwoqWF4dgGFexbL7e0EL1X/s0/2021%25E9%25AB%2598%25E9%259B%2584%25E5%2590%258C%25E5%25BF%2597%25E5%25A4%25A7%25E9%2581%258A%25E8%25A1%258C_qrcode.png\" width=\"150\" /></a></div><br /><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>Facebook線頂直播<br />時間:11/27 (拜六) 14:00~17:30<br /><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/KaohsiungPRIDE\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/KaohsiungPRIDE</a></b></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br /></p><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"background-color: white; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><span face=\"&quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif\" style=\"color: #666666; font-size: medium;\"><b>#</b></span></span><span face=\"&quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif\" style=\"color: #666666;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Lán</span>來講看māi 專欄，</b></span><span face=\"&quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif\" style=\"color: #666666;\"><b>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案</b></span><b style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif;\">。</b></div><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif;\"><span><b>台文通訊BONG報332期，2021年11月出刊。</b></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif;\"><br /></div><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif;\"><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\">--------------------------------------------</div></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: large; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #050505; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 15px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: medium;\"></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div></div></div></div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br style=\"color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\" /></div></div></div></div>"
  },
